msgid "Agricultural data (Ghana)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/agricultural-data-ghana.md:3
msgid ""
"Open Science Community Ghana (OSCG) used ODE to streamline the work with "
"manually-collected data and reduce the time to identify and correct "
"errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/agricultural-data-ghana.md:5
msgid ""
"The ODE interface enabled the team to easily define and enforce a "
"standard data structure, ensuring that every dataset adheres to a "
"consistent format. This directly solved their core problem of harmonising"
" the data that they receive from different sources."
msgstr ""

